Always Pushing the Boundaries? You Already Belong at RISK!
Our global-scale operations are based on strong internal expertise, analytics, and data research. We have expertise in iGaming operations (sports betting, online casino), digital and affiliate marketing, tech solutions, and data analytics.
We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our team.
Responsibilities:

• Manage and develop products across multiple brands and GEOs;

• Analyze user behavior, product funnels, and key business metrics;

• Identify product opportunities and bottlenecks through data, user research, and competitor analysis;

• Generate, validate, and prioritize product ideas that improve user experience and business results;

• Own initiatives from problem definition and requirements to release and post-launch analysis;

• Prepare clear product requirements, specifications, and user stories;

• Drive releases, identify blockers, and ensure tasks move forward;

• Work closely with CRM, Marketing, Analytics, Design, Content, and Technical teams;

• Participate in product roadmap planning and prioritization, bringing data-driven recommendations.

Requirements:

• 4+ years of Product Management experience, including hands-on experience with B2C products in iGaming;

• Strong understanding of online casino and/or sportsbook products, user journeys, and key metrics;

• Data-driven approach and experience evaluating product decisions through metrics, A/B tests, or alternative measurement methods;

• Strong ownership and ability to independently drive initiatives and remove blockers;

• Ability to work effectively in a fast-changing environment with multiple priorities;

• Strong technical understanding of platform capabilities, integrations, dependencies, and product constraints;

• Ability to balance user value, technical feasibility, and implementation effort when shaping product solutions;

• Fluent Ukrainian or Russian for internal communication;

• English - Intermediate or higher.

Will be a plus:

• Experience with Tableau or other BI tools;

• Experience with new market or product launches.

